    "text": "By Deb Albertson ,\n1 days ago The Lee Board of County Commissioners voted to request $7 million from funds awarded after the BP Deepwater Horizon Oil Spill for the restoration and expansion of the Fort Myers Beach Pier. The Fort Myers Beach Pier, a beloved tourist spot and fishing hub, was destroyed by Hurricane Ian in... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
